- Improved preferred-IP requests by adding the local identifier to User-Agent headers for the preferred-IP API, subscription generator, and subscription conversion requests.

### Change

- Improved version detection: the version endpoint consistently returns a numeric version.
- Improved subscription requests by adding the current version to User-Agent headers so servers can identify the client version.

