## [2.1.20260518183745] - 2026-05-18 18:37:45

### ADD

- Added `PRELOAD_RACE_DIAL` to control preloaded TCP race dialing. First connections can query A/AAAA records concurrently over DoH, prefer IPv4, and use IPv6 to fill the configured dial limit.

## [2.1.20260517185203] - 2026-05-17 18:52:03

### Debug

- Fixed WS/XHTTP/gRPC uploads by waiting for remote writes before processing the next chunk, preventing upload queue overflow.
- Improved the WS upload queue guard to `16MB / 4096` entries and correctly release pending writes during cleanup.

## [2.1.20260515185129] - 2026-05-15 18:51:29

### Change

- Improved Shadowsocks subscriptions: when TLS is disabled, the preferred port is rewritten to the no-TLS port. This does not apply to reverse-proxy IPs.
- Changed `GO2SOCKS5` from replacement mode to append mode. [PR #1202](https://github.com/cmliu/edgetunnel/pull/1202)

## [2.1.20260513042803] - 2026-05-13 04:28:03

### Change

- Optimized the VLESS hot path by pre-decoding UUIDs into 16-byte values and reducing copies when parsing initial packets. [Open-source reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)
- Improved WS Early Data with an 8KB limit and prevented ordinary WebSocket subprotocols from being injected as early data. [Open-source reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)
- Improved WS/XHTTP/gRPC uploads with bounded queues, small-packet batching, and 256KB backpressure protection. [Open-source reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)
- Optimized downstream GrainTCP sends by batching small packets and sending large packets directly after flushing the aggregator. [Open-source reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)
- Optimized TCP connection setup with four parallel direct/proxy-IP dial candidates while retaining existing proxy handshake logic. [Open-source reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)
- Improved WebSocket handshakes and transport ordering, added an `allowHalfOpen` fallback, and cleared `Sec-WebSocket-Extensions` from 101 responses. [Open-source reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)

