## 2026-10-15 - Network location lookup fix
- Updated IP metadata parsing for the current anonymous ipapi.is response schema (`country`, `asn`, `company`).
- Added a sequential geolocation fallback for IPs not covered by the existing metadata service, including IPv6 lookups.
- Corrected country-flag parsing so `AS` inside an ASN label is not mistaken for a country code.
